{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:242","content":{"id":242,"title":"33 如何清除病毒感染","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对抗病毒的整个环节："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"先天性免疫系统力图遏制感染迅速扩展"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大量化学信号散发，请求调高体温"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"产生更多黏液，让人剧烈咳嗽，把病毒排出体外"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自然杀伤细胞两三天后抵达战场，杀死不在现实 MHC-I 类分子的感染细胞"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"树突细胞对战场进行采样，放入自己的 MHC-I 类分子和 MHC-II 分子中，激活杀伤性 T 细胞和辅助性 T 细胞，辅助性 T 细胞激活 B 细胞生成抗体"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"杀伤性 T 细胞奔赴战场，一旦发现病毒抗原，就让感染细胞自尽，巨噬细胞再清除尸体"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"千百万抗体抵达战场，清除细胞外病毒，不让感染更多细胞"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大部分病毒被消灭，关闭免疫系统，以防造成严重破坏"}]}]}]},{"type":"divide-line","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"没什么没有更高的抗病毒药，因为病毒和人体细胞太相似了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么细菌可以通过抗生素杀死："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"青霉素：阻止细胞壁的合成，因为人体细胞只有细胞膜，没有细胞壁，所以只针对细菌"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"四环素：针对细菌的核糖体，虽然人体细胞也有核糖体，但是和细菌的不同，因此四环素只抑制细菌的核糖体"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是病毒和人体细胞的结构很像，在两个地方可以攻击病毒："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"细胞外：制造能和病毒受体结合的蛋白，但是因为病毒能和体细胞受体结合，这个和病毒受体结合的蛋白也会影响到人体的体细胞"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"细胞内：因为病毒使用的我们人体的细胞进行病毒的繁殖，无法生成只干扰病毒的药"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第三部分，恶意接管"},{"label":"33 如何清除病毒感染","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:242","type":"doc","id":242}}],"prevPage":{"title":"32 天生杀手","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:238","type":"doc","id":238}},"nextPage":{"title":"34 关闭免疫应答","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:243","type":"doc","id":243}},"createTime":1741821784926,"updateTime":1743303640527,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640527}}